@startuml
!include style.puml

title Protocol layering

rectangle "**L4 — Session**\nmutual authentication, key derivation, replay window" as L4 $phoneFill
rectangle "**L3 — Operations**\nopcodes, request/response correlation, ACK/NAK, retry" as L3 $phoneFill
rectangle "**L2 — Message PDU**\nheader, sequence, CRC-16, message authentication code" as L2 $phoneFill
rectangle "**L1 — Fragmentation**\nsplit and reassemble against the negotiated ATT_MTU" as L1 $storeFill
rectangle "**L0 — GATT**\nwrite-with-response on CMD, notification on RSP" as L0 $pumpFill

L4 --> L3
L3 --> L2
L2 --> L1
L1 --> L0

note right of L1
  Only L1 knows the MTU.
end note

note right of L4
  Only L4 knows the keys.
end note

note right of L2
  L2 and L3 are pure byte transformations
  and are the bulk of the JVM test suite.
end note

@enduml
